     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi, David.  Thanks for sending.  Interesting to see kidney cancer as that&#39;s a classic example of the challenges of variation (it&#39;s in chapter 2 of BDA and earlier in my paper with Phil Price on why all maps of parameter estimates are misleading).<div>Andrew</div><div><br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
